          "%md",
          "# Build a travel reservation service with a Select AI Supervisor Agent",
          "",
          "This notebook creates a small travel-agency data set and a **Supervisor Agent** team. A traveler can identify a reservation with their name and reservation code, request a hotel or rental-car alternative, and confirm a change.",
          "",
          "The team contains focused worker agents for reservation verification, hotel alternatives, car alternatives, and confirmed reservation changes. The supervisor receives every customer request and dynamically delegates only the relevant worker tasks."
        ],
