          "status" : "SUCCESS",
          "results" : [
            {
              "message" : "<h1 id=\"build-a-travel-reservation-service-with-a-select-ai-supervisor-agent\">Build a travel reservation service with a Select AI Supervisor Agent</h1>\n<p>This notebook creates a small travel-agency data set and a <strong>Supervisor Agent</strong> team. A traveler can identify a reservation with their name and reservation code, request a hotel or rental-car alternative, and confirm a change.</p>\n<p>The team contains focused worker agents for reservation verification, hotel alternatives, car alternatives, and confirmed reservation changes. The supervisor receives every customer request and dynamically delegates only the relevant worker tasks.</p>\n",
              "type" : "HTML"
            }
          ],
          "forms" : "[]"
        },
        "relations" : [ ],
        "dynamicFormParams" : "{}"
      },
      {
        "row" : 0,
        "col" : 0,
        "sizeX" : 0,
        "width" : 12,
        "title" : null,
        "hasTitle" : false,
        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          " # Build agentic solutions using Select AI:",
          " # \uD83C\uDFDD️ Travel Agency Supervisor Agent  \uD83C\uDFE8 \uD83D\uDE97",
          "",
          "Select AI Agent is Oracle Database\\’s framework for creating, deploying, and managing interactive AI agents. It is accessed through the `DBMS_CLOUD_AI_AGENT` package and combines an AI profile, ",
          "focused instructions, tools, conversational context, and database logic to complete business tasks.",
          "",
          "In this notebook, you will build a travel-reservation service. A traveler can identify their reservation by providing their name and reservation code, ",
          "ask for hotel or rental-car alternatives, and confirm a reservation update. The demonstration uses a **Select AI Supervisor Agent** to coordinate those interactions.",
          "",
          "#### What is an AI agent?",
          "",
          "An AI agent is a software system that receives a goal or request, reasons about the next appropriate action, uses available tools or data, and returns a response or completes an approved action.",
          "",
          "Generative AI is primarily used to create or summarize content. Agentic AI extends this capability by allowing an LLM to plan work, invoke tools, use returned results, ",
          "request clarification when needed, and complete multi-step tasks with appropriate human involvement.",
          "",
          "#### Select AI Agent concepts",
          "",
          "- **Agent team** — the set of agent-task pairs that together implement a business workflow.",
          "- **Agent** — an actor with a defined role and AI profile. An agent can perform one or more assigned tasks.",
          "- **Task** — a bounded activity with instructions, available tools, and optional human-input support.",
          "- **Tool** — a capability used by a task to access information or perform an action. Tools can call PL/SQL functions or use supported built-in capabilities.",
          "- **Conversation** — the context used to preserve a multi-turn interaction between the customer and the agent team.",
          "- **AI profile** — defines the AI provider, credential, model, and generation settings used by an agent.",
          "",
          "#### ReAct agentic pattern",
          "",
          "Select AI Agent uses the ReAct pattern: **Reasoning + Acting**. The agent evaluates the request, decides whether it needs more information or a tool, invokes the appropriate tool, interprets the result, and continues until it can provide a useful outcome.",
          "",
          "This pattern supports:",
          "",
          "- Planning the next action based on the customer request and prior results.",
          "- Selecting and invoking the appropriate tool.",
          "- Asking the customer for missing information or confirmation.",
          "- Evaluating tool results and deciding whether another action is required.",
          "- Returning a clear final response.",
          "",
          "#### Select AI Supervisor Agent",
          "",
          "A Select AI Supervisor Agent coordinates a team of specialized worker agents. Rather than following one fixed business flow, ",
          "the supervisor receives the customer request and dynamically chooses the worker agent-task pair that should handle the next subtask.",
          "",
          "In this travel demonstration, the supervisor can delegate to specialists that:",
          "",
          "- Verify a reservation using the traveler name and reservation code.",
          "- Find hotel alternatives for the reservation city.",
          "- Find rental-car alternatives for the reservation city.",
          "- Apply a selected hotel or car change only after explicit customer confirmation.",
          "",
          "Each worker handles a focused responsibility and has its own conversation thread. The supervisor therefore passes a self-contained request to each worker, ",
          "including the relevant reservation details, city, selected option, or customer confirmation. ",
          "The supervisor collects worker results, decides whether another specialist is needed, and returns one coordinated response to the traveler.",
          "",
          "A Supervisor Agent team uses `process: \"sequential\"` because one delegated subtask completes before the next begins. ",
          "However, the workflow is not fixed: the supervisor dynamically selects the appropriate worker and order at runtime. ",
          "For example, a traveler may ask directly for car alternatives, while a hotel-change request may require verification, hotel search, and a confirmed update.",
          "",
          "###### Pre-requisites",
          "",
          "For this notebook, the database administrator needs to grant the user the following:",
          "",
          "```sql",
          "GRANT EXECUTE ON DBMS_CLOUD_AI TO <username>;",
          "GRANT EXECUTE ON DBMS_CLOUD_AI_AGENT TO <username>;",
          "```",
          "Also required in case the user will create their own Credentials:",
          "```",
          "GRANT EXECUTE ON DBMS_CLOUD TO <username>;",
          "```",
          "---",
          "Copyright (c) 2026 Oracle Corporation  ",
          "###### [The Universal Permissive License (UPL), Version 1.0](https://oss.oracle.com/licenses/upl/)"
        ],
