              "message" : "<p>To open the documentation on a different browser Tab or Window, right-click on either link below</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Oracle Select AI documentation: <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/cloud/paas/autonomous-database/serverless/adbsb/select-ai.html\">https://docs.oracle.com/en/cloud/paas/autonomous-database/serverless/adbsb/select-ai.html</a></li>\n<li>DBMS_CLOUD_AI Package documentation: <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/cloud/paas/autonomous-database/serverless/adbsb/dbms-cloud-ai-package.html\">https://docs.oracle.com/en/cloud/paas/autonomous-database/serverless/adbsb/dbms-cloud-ai-package.html</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
