        "message" : [
          "%md",
          "",
          "## Travel reservation Supervisor Agent",
          "When travelers need to change plans, they may need help locating a reservation, finding a different hotel, comparing rental-car options, or confirming an update. ",
          "This travel-reservation scenario uses your database and LLM to interact with the traveler. ",
          "",
          "The customer provides their name and reservation code, and the agent can retrieve the current reservation, recommend available hotel or car alternatives, and update the reservation after the traveler explicitly confirms the selected option.",
          "",
          "You will construct a Supervisor Agent solution starting with travel data, PL/SQL functions, and tools, followed by worker tasks, specialized agents, and a supervisor-led agent team. ",
          "The AI profile identifies the LLM used by the supervisor and its worker agents.",
          "",
          "The Supervisor Agent receives each traveler request and dynamically selects the appropriate specialist. F",
          "or example, it can first verify a reservation, then request hotel alternatives, then route a confirmed choice to the reservation-change specialist. ",
          "",
          "This demonstrates a flexible workflow: worker tasks run one at a time, but the supervisor determines which worker to use and in what order based on the customer’s intent and the results returned by earlier workers."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization" : "html",
        "visualizationConfig" : null,
        "hideCode" : true,
        "hideResult" : false,
        "hideGutter" : true,
        "hideVizConfig" : true,
        "hideInIFrame" : false,
        "enabled" : true,
        "forms" : "[]",
        "result" : {
          "startTime" : 1787856954109,
          "endTime" : 1787856954207,
          "interpreter" : "md.medium",
          "taskStatus" : "SUCCESS",
          "status" : "SUCCESS",
          "results" : [
            {
              "message" : "<h2 id=\"travel-reservation-supervisor-agent\">Travel reservation Supervisor Agent</h2>\n<p>When travelers need to change plans, they may need help locating a reservation, finding a different hotel, comparing rental-car options, or confirming an update.\nThis travel-reservation scenario uses your database and LLM to interact with the traveler.</p>\n<p>The customer provides their name and reservation code, and the agent can retrieve the current reservation, recommend available hotel or car alternatives, and update the reservation after the traveler explicitly confirms the selected option.</p>\n<p>You will construct a Supervisor Agent solution starting with travel data, PL/SQL functions, and tools, followed by worker tasks, specialized agents, and a supervisor-led agent team.\nThe AI profile identifies the LLM used by the supervisor and its worker agents.</p>\n<p>The Supervisor Agent receives each traveler request and dynamically selects the appropriate specialist. F\nor example, it can first verify a reservation, then request hotel alternatives, then route a confirmed choice to the reservation-change specialist.</p>\n<p>This demonstrates a flexible workflow: worker tasks run one at a time, but the supervisor determines which worker to use and in what order based on the customer’s intent and the results returned by earlier workers.</p>\n",
              "type" : "HTML"
            }
          ],
          "forms" : "[]"
