          "%md",
          "# Phase 2: Create safe, focused travel tools",
          "",
          "The workers call small PL/SQL functions instead of receiving direct broad database access. The update function validates the traveler identity, reservation status, and selected inventory before changing a reservation. The change worker must request explicit customer confirmation before it calls that tool."
        ],
