            {
              "message" : "<h1 id=\"phase-2-create-safe-focused-travel-tools\">Phase 2: Create safe, focused travel tools</h1>\n<p>The workers call small PL/SQL functions instead of receiving direct broad database access. The update function validates the traveler identity, reservation status, and selected inventory before changing a reservation. The change worker must request explicit customer confirmation before it calls that tool.</p>\n",
              "type" : "HTML"
