              "message" : "TOOL_ID\tTOOL_NAME\tATTRIBUTE_NAME\tATTRIBUTE_VALUE\tLAST_MODIFIED\n366\tCHANGE_TRAVEL_RESERVATION_TOOL\tinstruction\tChanges hotel and/or car selections only after explicit customer confirmation.\t2026-08-27 18:56:00.864235 UTC\n366\tCHANGE_TRAVEL_RESERVATION_TOOL\tfunction\tCHANGE_TRAVEL_RESERVATION\t2026-08-27 18:56:00.864235 UTC\n365\tFIND_CAR_ALTERNATIVES_TOOL\tinstruction\tFind currently available rental cars in the requested reservation city.\t2026-08-27 18:56:00.81463 UTC\n365\tFIND_CAR_ALTERNATIVES_TOOL\tfunction\tFIND_CAR_ALTERNATIVES\t2026-08-27 18:56:00.81463 UTC\n364\tFIND_HOTEL_ALTERNATIVES_TOOL\tinstruction\tFind currently available hotels in the requested reservation city.\t2026-08-27 18:56:00.765333 UTC\n364\tFIND_HOTEL_ALTERNATIVES_TOOL\tfunction\tFIND_HOTEL_ALTERNATIVES\t2026-08-27 18:56:00.765333 UTC\n363\tGET_TRAVEL_RESERVATION_TOOL\tinstruction\tRetrieve one reservation only after customer name and reservation code are provided.\t2026-08-27 18:56:00.704382 UTC\n363\tGET_TRAVEL_RESERVATION_TOOL\tfunction\tGET_TRAVEL_RESERVATION\t2026-08-27 18:56:00.704382 UTC\n316\tBUILD_EMAIL_TOOL\tinstruction\tThis tool constructs an email string using as input details from the customer interaction as to the product they want to return or get a refund.\t2026-08-19 16:54:54.882502 UTC\n316\tBUILD_EMAIL_TOOL\ttool_inputs\t[{\"name\":\"p_email_type\",\"description\":\"Only supported value is 'refund' and 'replacement' \"}]\t2026-08-19 16:54:54.882502 UTC\n316\tBUILD_EMAIL_TOOL\tfunction\tbuild_return_email\t2026-08-19 16:54:54.882502 UTC\n317\tSALES_RAG_TOOL\ttool_type\tRAG\t2026-08-19 16:56:12.860541 UTC\n317\tSALES_RAG_TOOL\tinstruction\tThis tool is used to search the knowledgebase using Retrieval Augmented Generation search. Input should be a search query. This tool will return search results.\t2026-08-19 16:56:12.860541 UTC\n317\tSALES_RAG_TOOL\ttool_params\t{\"profile_name\":\"SALES_AGENT_RAG_PROFILE\"}\t2026-08-19 16:56:12.860541 UTC\n315\tUPDATE_ORDER_STATUS_TOOL\tinstruction\tThis tool updates the database to reflect return status change. Always confirm user name and order number with user before update status\t2026-08-19 16:50:48.237621 UTC\n315\tUPDATE_ORDER_STATUS_TOOL\tfunction\tupdate_customer_order_status\t2026-08-19 16:50:48.237621 UTC\n212\tADBS_PROVISIONING_TOOL\tinstruction\tProvisions an Oracle Autonomous Database. Use LIST_SUBSCRIBED_REGIONS_TOOL and LIST_COMPARTMENTS_TOOL to gather prerequisites, then confirm all choices before provisioning.\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.558724 UTC\n212\tADBS_PROVISIONING_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.provision_adbs_tool\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.558724 UTC\n214\tADBS_UNPROVISION_TOOL\tinstruction\tDrops an Oracle Autonomous Database (confirm before calling).\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.909124 UTC\n214\tADBS_UNPROVISION_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.drop_autonomous_database\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.909124 UTC\n220\tDATABASE_RESTART_TOOL\tinstruction\tRestarts the specified Autonomous Database (confirm before calling).\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.042951 UTC\n220\tDATABASE_RESTART_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.restart_autonomous_database\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.042951 UTC\n226\tDELETE_KEY_STORE_TOOL\tinstruction\tDelete a key store by key_store_id (confirm before calling).\t2026-03-05 20:08:52.098221 UTC\n226\tDELETE_KEY_STORE_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.delete_key_store\t2026-03-05 20:08:52.098221 UTC\n217\tGET_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_DETAILS_TOOL\tinstruction\tFetches metadata for a specific Autonomous Database by OCID.\t2026-03-05 20:08:50.502021 UTC\n217\tGET_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_DETAILS_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.get_autonomous_database_details\t2026-03-05 20:08:50.502021 UTC\n211\tGET_COMPARTMENT_OCID_BY_NAME_TOOL\tinstruction\tGiven a compartment name, return its OCID (uses LIST_COMPARTMENTS_TOOL internally).\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.38813 UTC\n211\tGET_COMPARTMENT_OCID_BY_NAME_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.get_compartment_ocid_by_name\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.38813 UTC\n221\tGET_MAINTENANCE_RUN_HISTORY_TOOL\tinstruction\tRetrieve details for a specific maintenance run history by maintenance_run_history_id.\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.220312 UTC\n221\tGET_MAINTENANCE_RUN_HISTORY_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.get_maintenance_run_history_json\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.220312 UTC\n227\tLIST_ACDS_TOOL\tinstruction\tList Autonomous Container Databases in a compartment.\t2026-03-05 20:08:52.271009 UTC\n227\tLIST_ACDS_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.list_autonomous_container_database\t2026-03-05 20:08:52.271009 UTC\n228\tLIST_ADB_BACKUPS_TOOL\tinstruction\tList Autonomous Database backups for a given compartment and autonomous_database_id.\t2026-03-05 20:08:52.441403 UTC\n228\tLIST_ADB_BACKUPS_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.list_autonomous_database_backups\t2026-03-05 20:08:52.441403 UTC\n213\tLIST_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASES_TOOL\tinstruction\tLists Oracle Autonomous Databases in a given compartment and region.\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.731477 UTC\n213\tLIST_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASES_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.list_autonomous_databases\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.731477 UTC\n210\tLIST_COMPARTMENTS_TOOL\tinstruction\tLists compartments in the tenancy. Use to help the user pick a compartment for Autonomous Database operations.\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.216905 UTC\n210\tLIST_COMPARTMENTS_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.list_compartments\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.216905 UTC\n224\tLIST_DB_HOMES_TOOL\tinstruction\tList DB homes in a given compartment.\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.750041 UTC\n224\tLIST_DB_HOMES_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.list_db_homes\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.750041 UTC\n223\tLIST_KEY_STORES_TOOL\tinstruction\tList key stores in a given compartment.\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.57166 UTC\n223\tLIST_KEY_STORES_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.list_key_stores\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.57166 UTC\n209\tLIST_SUBSCRIBED_REGIONS_TOOL\tinstruction\tLists all Oracle Cloud regions subscribed by the current tenancy. Use to help the user pick a region.\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.04179 UTC\n209\tLIST_SUBSCRIBED_REGIONS_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.list_subscribed_regions\t2026-03-05 20:08:49.04179 UTC\n215\tMANAGE_AUTONOMOUS_DB_POWER_TOOL\tinstruction\tStarts or stops an Autonomous Database based on action START or STOP (confirm before calling).\t2026-03-05 20:08:50.086002 UTC\n215\tMANAGE_AUTONOMOUS_DB_POWER_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.manage_autonomous_db_power\t2026-03-05 20:08:50.086002 UTC\n225\tSHRINK_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\tinstruction\tShrink an Autonomous Database's storage (confirm before calling).\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.923547 UTC\n225\tSHRINK_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.shrink_autonomous_database\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.923547 UTC\n219\tSTART_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\tinstruction\tStarts the specified Autonomous Database.\t2026-03-05 20:08:50.867504 UTC\n219\tSTART_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.start_autonomous_database\t2026-03-05 20:08:50.867504 UTC\n218\tSTOP_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.stop_autonomous_database\t2026-03-05 20:08:50.693904 UTC\n218\tSTOP_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\tinstruction\tStops the specified Autonomous Database (confirm before calling).\t2026-03-05 20:08:50.693904 UTC\n222\tUPDATE_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\tinstruction\tUpdate one or more attributes of an Autonomous Database. Only include parameters explicitly provided by the user; omit any omitted values.\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.39867 UTC\n222\tUPDATE_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.update_autonomous_database\t2026-03-05 20:08:51.39867 UTC\n216\tUPDATE_AUTONOMOUS_DB_RESOURCES_TOOL\tinstruction\tUpdates the CPU core count and/or storage size (TB) for an Autonomous Database (confirm before calling).\t2026-03-05 20:08:50.310155 UTC\n216\tUPDATE_AUTONOMOUS_DB_RESOURCES_TOOL\tfunction\toci_autonomous_database_agents.update_autonomous_db_resources\t2026-03-05 20:08:50.310155 UTC\n",
