          "results" : [
            {
              "message" : "TASK_ID\tTASK_NAME\tATTRIBUTE_NAME\tATTRIBUTE_VALUE\tLAST_MODIFIED\n129\tCAR_ALTERNATIVES_TASK\tinstruction\tRecommend available rental-car alternatives. Use the reservation city supplied in the delegated request. If city is absent, ask the customer for it. Call FIND_CAR_ALTERNATIVES_TOOL and return options with their car IDs. Do not change a reservation.\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.793976 UTC\n129\tCAR_ALTERNATIVES_TASK\tenable_human_tool\ttrue\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.793976 UTC\n129\tCAR_ALTERNATIVES_TASK\ttools\t[\"FIND_CAR_ALTERNATIVES_TOOL\"]\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.793976 UTC\n130\tCHANGE_RESERVATION_TASK\tinstruction\tChange a confirmed reservation only when customer name, reservation code, selected hotel ID and/or car ID, and explicit confirmation are present. If confirmation is missing, summarize the proposed change and ask for confirmation. On confirmation call CHANGE_TRAVEL_RESERVATION_TOOL.\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.85513 UTC\n130\tCHANGE_RESERVATION_TASK\tenable_human_tool\ttrue\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.85513 UTC\n130\tCHANGE_RESERVATION_TASK\ttools\t[\"CHANGE_TRAVEL_RESERVATION_TOOL\"]\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.85513 UTC\n128\tHOTEL_ALTERNATIVES_TASK\tinstruction\tRecommend available hotel alternatives. Use the reservation city supplied in the delegated request. If city is absent, ask the customer for it. Call FIND_HOTEL_ALTERNATIVES_TOOL and return options with their hotel IDs. Do not change a reservation.\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.73246 UTC\n128\tHOTEL_ALTERNATIVES_TASK\tenable_human_tool\ttrue\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.73246 UTC\n128\tHOTEL_ALTERNATIVES_TASK\ttools\t[\"FIND_HOTEL_ALTERNATIVES_TOOL\"]\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.73246 UTC\n131\tTRAVEL_SUPERVISOR$TASK\tinstruction\tRespond to user requests.\t2026-08-27 18:56:04.059926 UTC\n127\tVERIFY_RESERVATION_TASK\ttools\t[\"GET_TRAVEL_RESERVATION_TOOL\"]\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.659923 UTC\n127\tVERIFY_RESERVATION_TASK\tenable_human_tool\ttrue\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.659923 UTC\n127\tVERIFY_RESERVATION_TASK\tinstruction\tVerify a travel reservation. Ask for both the customer name and reservation code if either is missing. When both are supplied, call GET_TRAVEL_RESERVATION_TOOL and clearly report the result.\t2026-08-27 18:56:01.659923 UTC\n80\tGENERATE_EMAIL_TASK\tinstruction\tUse the customer information and product details to generate an email in a professional format. The email should:1. Include a greeting to the customer by name2. Specify the item being returned, the order number, and the reason for the return3. If it is a refund, state the refund will be issued to the credit card on record.4. If it is a replacement, state that the replacement will be shipped in 3-5 business days.\t2026-08-19 16:53:35.662027 UTC\n82\tHANDLE_PRODUCT_RETURN_TASK\tinstruction\tProcess a product return request from a customer: {query} Steps to be followed: 1. Ask customer the reason for return (no longer needed, arrived too late, box broken, or defective)2. If no longer needed:   a. Inform customer to ship the product at their expense back to us.   b. Update the order status to return_shipment_pending using Update_Order_Status_Tool.3. If it arrived too late:   a. Ask customer if they want a refund.   b. If the customer wants a refund, then confirm refund processed and update the order status to refund_completed4. If the product was defective or the box broken:   a. Ask customer if they want a replacement or a refund or if they would like to consider alternative recommendations   b. If a replacement, inform customer replacement is on its way and they will receive a return shipping label for the defective product, then update the order status to replaced   c. If a refund, inform customer to print out the return shipping label for the defective product, return the product, and update the order status to refund   d. If consider alternative recommendations, use the RAG tool to present 2 alternatives to the customer and let them decide if they want this product or the original one5. After the completion of a return or refund, ask if you can help with anything else.   End the task and generatea a final answer only if user does not need help on anything else\t2026-08-19 16:56:13.249446 UTC\n82\tHANDLE_PRODUCT_RETURN_TASK\ttools\t[\"Update_Order_Status_Tool\",\"sales_rag_tool\"]\t2026-08-19 16:56:13.249446 UTC\n13\tOCI_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TASKS\tinstruction\tIdentify the intent of the user request and determine the correct Autonomous Database operation. Prompt the user only for necessary missing details. Ask clarifying questions if intent is ambiguous. When presenting any list, object, or JSON structure to the user, format it in a human-readable way. Confirm destructive actions before execution. User request: {query}\t2026-03-04 16:56:20.773323 America/New_York\n13\tOCI_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TASKS\ttools\t[\"LIST_SUBSCRIBED_REGIONS_TOOL\",\"LIST_COMPARTMENTS_TOOL\",\"GET_COMPARTMENT_OCID_BY_NAME_TOOL\",\"LIST_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASES_TOOL\",\"GET_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_DETAILS_TOOL\",\"ADBS_PROVISIONING_TOOL\",\"ADBS_UNPROVISION_TOOL\",\"START_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\",\"STOP_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\",\"DATABASE_RESTART_TOOL\",\"MANAGE_AUTONOMOUS_DB_POWER_TOOL\",\"UPDATE_AUTONOMOUS_DB_RESOURCES_TOOL\",\"GET_MAINTENANCE_RUN_HISTORY_TOOL\",\"UPDATE_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\",\"LIST_KEY_STORES_TOOL\",\"LIST_DB_HOMES_TOOL\",\"SHRINK_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TOOL\",\"DELETE_KEY_STORE_TOOL\",\"LIST_ACDS_TOOL\",\"LIST_ADB_BACKUPS_TOOL\"]\t2026-03-04 16:56:20.773323 America/New_York\n13\tOCI_AUTONOMOUS_DATABASE_TASKS\tenable_human_tool\ttrue\t2026-03-04 16:56:20.773323 America/New_York\n",
